      "context": "concept — mobile web player navigation — Navigation is one floating island that carries playback: artwork with a progress ring, four tabs (Home, Search, Library, Jam) and play. It shrinks to artwork + track while scrolling down, widens for live activity (Jam, Bitrate Connect, releases), shows quick actions on hold and blooms into the player on tap or swipe up; swipe sideways skips. Home resumes, tunes by feeling and shows bento tiles instead of shelves."
    },
